Kin-Fusion Campout
A fusion dance unconference at Rhizome Springs on Saltspring island in beautiful BC, Canada (https://www.rhizomesprings.com/)
A community based, not for profit event. 3 days of dance, DJs, live music, unconference and cocreation
The event is capped at 90 people
We'll have a form for signup. The form data should land in a google sheet
There'll also be a form for the unconference, so that people can sign up to do workshops
There'll also be a form for community DJs to sign up to do a set

Sliding scale cost: $300 base price, $350 mid-tier price, $400 High tier. Higher tiers will help support a better event as well as scholarships. partial scholarships available to those in need.

Dates: Arrive Thursday September 10th or Friday September 11th 2026. Event starts September 11th 2026. Ends Sunday Night, but participants will be allowed to stay til Monday morning if they wish

Food will be provided by the event

All participants will all be called on to help: everyone will be asked to volunteer in small ways to make the event run smoothly. This is a community event, and we're all a part of creating it

The website should be simple, run on cloudflare's free tier, and have minimimal dependencies. The visuals are in @assets/
The domain name is kinfusion.dance

It should be heavy on photos, simple to navigate, and feel easy to the non-technical users signing up.

payments will be done by interac etransfer or via wyse, to the rhizome springs address

Bring your kids: the event is intended to be family friendly: we will be working to provide a dedicated quiet space and child friendly unconference activities. Kids 12 and under are free, older children pay the normal price for the event

